urname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Sipit</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Kurt</surname><given-names>EB</given-names></name><article-title>Endobronchial cryobiopsy or forceps biopsy for lung cancer diagnosis</article-title><source>Ann Thorac Med</source><year>2010</year><volume>5</volume><issue>4</issue><fpage>242</fpage><lpage>246</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.4103/1817-1737.69117</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">20981186</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>